  {
    "level": 3,
    "topic": "Solving by Factorization",
    "question": "Solve the quadratic equation $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0$.",
    "question_zh": "\u89e3\u4e8c\u6b21\u65b9\u7a0b $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0$\u3002",
    "answer": "x = 2 or x = 3",
    "answer_zh": "x = 2 \u6216 x = 3",
    "steps": [
      "Factorize the quadratic expression: $(x - 2)(x - 3) = 0$.",
      "Set each factor to zero: $x - 2 = 0$ or $x - 3 = 0$.",
      "Solutions: $x = 2$ or $x = 3$."
    ],
    "steps_zh": [
      "\u5c07\u4e8c\u6b21\u5f0f\u56e0\u5f0f\u5206\u89e3\uff1a$(x - 2)(x - 3) = 0$\u3002",
      "\u5c07\u6bcf\u500b\u56e0\u5f0f\u8a2d\u70ba\u96f6\uff1a$x - 2 = 0$ \u6216 $x - 3 = 0$\u3002",
      "\u89e3\u70ba\uff1a$x = 2$ \u6216 $x = 3$\u3002"
    ]
  },
  {
    "level": 3,
    "topic": "Nature of Roots",
    "question": "Find the discriminant of $x^2 - 4x + 4 = 0$ and state the nature of its roots.",
    "question_zh": "\u6c42 $x^2 - 4x + 4 = 0$ \u7684\u5224\u5225\u5f0f\uff0c\u4e26\u5beb\u51fa\u5176\u6839\u7684\u6027\u8cea\u3002",
    "answer": "$\\Delta = 0$, equal real roots",
    "answer_zh": "$\\Delta = 0$\uff0c\u6709\u7b49\u5be6\u6839",
    "steps": [
      "Identify $a=1, b=-4, c=4$.",
      "Discriminant $\\Delta = b^2 - 4ac = (-4)^2 - 4(1)(4) = 16 - 16 = 0$.",
      "Since $\\Delta = 0$, the equation has one real root (equal real roots)."
    ],
    "steps_zh": [
      "\u8fa8\u8b58 $a=1, b=-4, c=4$\u3002",
      "\u5224\u5225\u5f0f $\\Delta = b^2 - 4ac = (-4)^2 - 4(1)(4) = 16 - 16 = 0$\u3002",
      "\u7531\u65bc $\\Delta = 0$\uff0c\u8a72\u65b9\u7a0b\u6709\u4e00\u500b\u5be6\u6839\uff08\u7b49\u5be6\u6839\uff09\u3002"
    ]
  },
  {
    "level": 3,
    "topic": "Quadratic Formula",
    "question": "Use the quadratic formula to solve $x^2 + 2x - 1 = 0$. (Leave answer in surd form)",
    "question_zh": "\u5229\u7528\u4e8c\u6b21\u516c\u5f0f\u89e3 $x^2 + 2x - 1 = 0$\u3002\uff08\u7b54\u6848\u4ee5\u6839\u5f0f\u8868\u793a\uff09",
    "answer": "x = -1 \\pm \\sqrt{2}",
    "steps": [
      "Quadratic formula: $x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$.",
      "$x = \\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{2^2 - 4(1)(-1)}}{2(1)} = \\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{4 + 4}}{2}$.",
      "$x = \\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{8}}{2} = \\frac{-2 \\pm 2\\sqrt{2}}{2} = -1 \\pm \\sqrt{2}$."
    ],
    "steps_zh": [
      "\u4e8c\u6b21\u516c\u5f0f\uff1a$x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$\u3002",
      "$x = \\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{2^2 - 4(1)(-1)}}{2(1)} = \\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{4 + 4}}{2}$\u3002",
      "$x = \\frac{-2 \\pm \\sqrt{8}}{2} = \\frac{-2 \\pm 2\\sqrt{2}}{2} = -1 \\pm \\sqrt{2}$\u3002"
    ]
  },
  {
    "level": 3,
