    "question": "Find the range of values of $k$ such that $x^2 + 6x + k = 0$ has two distinct real roots.",
    "question_zh": "\u6c42 $k$ \u7684\u53d6\u503c\u7bc4\u570d\uff0c\u4f7f\u5f97 $x^2 + 6x + k = 0$ \u6709\u5169\u500b\u4e0d\u76f8\u7b49\u7684\u5be6\u6839\u3002",
    "answer": "k < 9",
    "steps": [
