    "question_zh": "\u82e5 $\\alpha$ \u70ba $x^2 - 3x + 1 = 0$ \u7684\u6839\uff0c\u6c42 $\\alpha^3 - 3\\alpha^2 + \\alpha + 5$ \u7684\u503c\u3002",
