      "Thus, $\\alpha(\\alpha^2 - 3\\alpha + 1) = \\alpha(0) = 0$.",
      "The expression simplifies to $0 + 5 = 5$."
    ],
    "steps_zh": [
      "\u5c07\u8868\u9054\u5f0f\u5206\u7d44\u56e0\u5f0f\u5206\u89e3\uff1a$\\alpha^3 - 3\\alpha^2 + \\alpha = \\alpha(\\alpha^2 - 3\\alpha + 1)$\u3002",
      "\u7531\u65bc $\\alpha$ \u662f\u6839\uff0c$\\alpha^2 - 3\\alpha + 1 = 0$\u3002",
      "\u56e0\u6b64\uff0c$\\alpha(\\alpha^2 - 3\\alpha + 1) = \\alpha(0) = 0$\u3002",
      "\u8a72\u8868\u9054\u5f0f\u7c21\u5316\u70ba $0 + 5 = 5$\u3002"
    ]
  },
