    "question": "The graph of $y = x^2 + ax + b$ has its vertex at $(1, 2)$. Find $a$ and $b$.",
    "question_zh": "\u5df2\u77e5 $y = x^2 + ax + b$ \u7684\u9802\u9ede\u5728 $(1, 2)$\u3002\u6c42 $a$ \u53ca $b$ \u7684\u503c\u3002",
    "answer": "a = -2, b = 3",
