      "Expand: $y = x^2 - 2x + 1 + 2 = x^2 - 2x + 3$.",
      "Compare with $y = x^2 + ax + b$: $a = -2, b = 3$."
    ],
    "steps_zh": [
      "\u9802\u9ede\u5f0f\uff1a$y = (x - 1)^2 + 2$\u3002",
      "\u5c55\u958b\uff1a$y = x^2 - 2x + 1 + 2 = x^2 - 2x + 3$\u3002",
      "\u8207 $y = x^2 + ax + b$ \u6bd4\u8f03\uff1a$a = -2, b = 3$\u3002"
    ]
