  {
    "level": 7,
    "topic": "Reciprocal Roots",
    "question": "The roots of $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$ are $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$. Show that the equation whose roots are $1/\\alpha$ and $1/\\beta$ is $cx^2 + bx + a = 0$.",
    "question_zh": "\u5df2\u77e5 $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$ \u7684\u6839\u70ba $\\alpha$ \u53ca $\\beta$\u3002\u8b49\u660e\u4ee5 $1/\\alpha$ \u53ca $1/\\beta$ \u70ba\u6839\u7684\u65b9\u7a0b\u662f $cx^2 + bx + a = 0$\u3002",
    "answer": "Proved (cx^2 + bx + a = 0)",
    "answer_zh": "\u5df2\u8b49\u660e (cx^2 + bx + a = 0)",
    "steps": [
      "New sum $S = 1/\\alpha + 1/\\beta = (\\alpha + \\beta)/(\\alpha\\beta) = (-b/a)/(c/a) = -b/c$.",
      "New product $P = (1/\\alpha)(1/\\beta) = 1/(\\alpha\\beta) = 1/(c/a) = a/c$.",
      "Equation: $x^2 - (-b/c)x + (a/c) = 0 \\Rightarrow x^2 + (b/c)x + (a/c) = 0$.",
      "Multiply by $c$: $cx^2 + bx + a = 0$."
    ],
    "steps_zh": [
      "\u65b0\u548c $S = 1/\\alpha + 1/\\beta = (\\alpha + \\beta)/(\\alpha\\beta) = (-b/a)/(c/a) = -b/c$\u3002",
      "\u65b0\u7a4d $P = (1/\\alpha)(1/\\beta) = 1/(\\alpha\\beta) = 1/(c/a) = a/c$\u3002",
      "\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a$x^2 - (-b/c)x + (a/c) = 0 \\Rightarrow x^2 + (b/c)x + (a/c) = 0$\u3002",
      "\u4e58\u4ee5 $c$\uff1a$cx^2 + bx + a = 0$\u3002"
    ]
  },
  {
    "level": 7,
    "topic": "Applied Optimization",
    "question": "A gardener has 40 m of fencing to enclose a rectangular garden. What is the maximum area possible?",
    "question_zh": "\u4e00\u540d\u5712\u4e01\u6709 40 m \u7684\u570d\u6b04\u4f86\u570d\u5408\u4e00\u500b\u9577\u65b9\u5f62\u82b1\u5712\u3002\u6240\u80fd\u570d\u5408\u7684\u6700\u5927\u9762\u7a4d\u662f\u591a\u5c11\uff1f",
    "answer": "100 m^2",
    "steps": [
      "Let side lengths be $x$ and $y$. Perimeter $2(x + y) = 40 \\Rightarrow x + y = 20 \\Rightarrow y = 20 - x$.",
      "Area $A = x(20 - x) = 20x - x^2$.",
      "This is a downward parabola with vertex at $x = -20/(2 \\times -1) = 10$.",
      "Maximum Area $= 20(10) - 10^2 = 200 - 100 = 100$ m$^2$."
    ],
    "steps_zh": [
      "\u8a2d\u908a\u9577\u70ba $x$ \u53ca $y$\u3002\u5468\u754c $2(x + y) = 40 \\Rightarrow x + y = 20 \\Rightarrow y = 20 - x$\u3002",
      "\u9762\u7a4d $A = x(20 - x) = 20x - x^2$\u3002",
      "\u9019\u662f\u4e00\u500b\u958b\u53e3\u5411\u4e0b\u7684\u62cb\u7269\u7dda\uff0c\u9802\u9ede\u5728 $x = -20/(2 \\times -1) = 10$ \u8655\u3002",
      "\u6700\u5927\u9762\u7a4d $= 20(10) - 10^2 = 200 - 100 = 100$ m$^2$\u3002"
    ]
  },
